#: includes/modules/class-zappoppop-woo-cart.php:783
msgid "Free shipping bar: add a Progress Bar layer, set its mode to \"Auto: WooCommerce free shipping\" and write its label like: Add {shipping_remaining} for free shipping || You got free shipping!"
